  "item": [
    {
      "id": "43faff01-3cf0-445f-97f0-8b80a1af315c",
      "name": "Connectors",
      "description": {
        "content": "\nThe controller is responsible for managing company links (connectors). \nThe controller allows creating new connectors which user can use them on web or mobile app. \nConnector can can include information about dataObjects and current user.\n",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
      "item": [
        {
          "id": "6bbb9d89-449c-490f-92a1-d2e206798a5d",
          "name": "Create a new connector",
          "request": {
            "name": "Create a new connector",
            "description": {
              "content": "\nA connector can include user / dataObject variables.  \nAppropriate format is required  \n#### Web Regex - website url  `https://spotio2.com`\n* ^(((?i)(http|https):\\/\\/){1}(\\w+)+([\\p{L}0-9_ \\~\\!\\@\\#\\$\\%\\^\\&amp;\\*\\(\\)_\\-\\=\\+\\\\\\/\\?\\.\\:\\;\\,{}]*)?)$  \n#### Mobile Regex - deep link   `slack://open?team={TEAM_ID}`\n* ^(((\\w+):\\/\\/){1}([\\p{L}0-9_ \\~\\!\\@\\#\\$\\%\\^\\&amp;\\*\\(\\)_\\-\\=\\+\\\\\\/\\?\\.\\:\\;\\,{}]*)?)$\n",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
